# Admin Assets

## JavaScript (`admin/js/launchdek-admin.js`)

- Wrap in an IIFE with `'use strict'`; guard on `typeof launchdekAdmin`.
- REST helpers: `request()`, `get()`, `post()`, `put()`, `del()` — all send `X-WP-Nonce` header. `resolveApiPath(path)` merges query strings correctly when `restUrl` uses plain permalinks (`?rest_route=…`).
- DOM helpers: `el( tag, attrs, children )`, `fillSelect( select, items, valueKey, labelKey, placeholder )`; notices via `notice( container, message, type )`.
- Scope queries to `.launchdek-admin` or `[data-launchdek-page]`.
- No jQuery unless WordPress already loads it.
- On `DOMContentLoaded`: set `data-launchdek-ready="true"`, then call global modal inits (`initTemplatePicker`, `initOnboarding`) before page inits; `initSettings()` runs last.

### Global modal inits (any screen with modal markup)

| Function | Modal | Notes |
|----------|-------|-------|
| `initTemplatePicker()` | `#launchdek-template-picker-modal` | Runs when modal partial is present; exposes `window.launchdekOpenTemplatePicker(callbacks)` |
| `initOnboarding()` | `#launchdek-onboarding-modal` | Runs when modal partial is present; exposes `window.launchdekOpenOnboarding()` |

### Page init functions

| Function | Page attr | Key elements |
|----------|-----------|--------------|
| `initDashboard()` | `dashboard` | `#launchdek-stats`, `#launchdek-ticker`, `#launchdek-log-feed` (preloaded via `launchdekAdmin.dashboard` or PHP partial; `data-launchdek-preloaded="1"` skips initial fetch; entries use `show_site_label` for separate site badge vs embedded site name in message), quick launch (`#launchdek-quick-site`, `#launchdek-quick-checklist`, `#launchdek-quick-launch`, `#launchdek-quick-result`) |
| `initSettings()` | `settings` | `#launchdek-panel-layout` + `#launchdek-panel-layout-preview` (`initPanelLayoutPreview()` — syncs `data-layout` and description on change); `#launchdek-show-onboarding` → `POST /onboarding/reset` then `launchdekOpenOnboarding()` |
| `initSites()` | `sites` | toolbar (`#launchdek-add-site`, `#launchdek-connection-tester`, `#launchdek-activity-logs` → Activity Logs page), tag/group filters, `#launchdek-sites-table` (`.launchdek-site-row` + expandable `.launchdek-site-runs-row` with `.launchdek-site-history-toggle` → `GET /sites/{id}/runs`; **View run** links to `?page={slug}-automation&run_id={id}`; connection dot + warning icon, health badge, **Client panel** badge when `client_agent`), site modal (`#launchdek-site-modal`, panel install/retry via `GET /panel/bootstrap` download + `retryPanelInstall()` → `POST /sites/{id}/panel/install`), push checklist modal (`#launchdek-push-checklist-modal`, `#launchdek-push-checklist-select`, `#launchdek-push-to-client`, `POST /runs` with `push_to_client`), standalone connection tester modal; `refreshStaleSiteConnectionsInBackground()` re-tests sites older than 30 minutes |
| `initActivityLogs()` | `activity-logs` | filters (`#launchdek-activity-logs-site`, `#launchdek-activity-logs-status`, `#launchdek-activity-logs-date-from`, `#launchdek-activity-logs-date-to`, `#launchdek-activity-logs-search`, `#launchdek-activity-logs-filter`), table `#launchdek-activity-logs-table`; loads `GET /logs/feed?detailed=1` (limit 200); honors `?site_id=` query param |
| `initChecklists()` | `checklists` | page tabs (`.launchdek-page-tab`, `[data-launchdek-tab-panel]`); `#launchdek-new-checklist` (hidden on Templates tab) opens template picker (clone → editor) or blank; `#launchdek-auto-capture` opens auto-capture modal; builder panel: `#launchdek-checklist-list`, editor (`#launchdek-checklist-editor`), canvas (`#launchdek-checklist-canvas`, `#launchdek-canvas-steps`, `.launchdek-canvas-node-chevron` toggles step config), step config (`#launchdek-step-config`, `#ld-step-show-note` for manual `show_note_field`, `#ld-validate-api` shows validation `errors` and `warnings` from `/checklists/{id}/validate-step`), save/export/delete/import controls |
| `initAutomation()` | `automation` | batch queue (`#launchdek-batch-table`, `#launchdek-run-checklist`), run controls (`#launchdek-run-steps`, `#launchdek-run-auto`, `#launchdek-run-next`, `#launchdek-run-push-client` — hidden until a run is active; posts `POST /runs/{id}/push-client` for snapshot re-push + bundle sync), run tracker renders step notes (`.launchdek-run-step-notes`, author · timestamp meta, optional `.launchdek-run-step-note-attachment` thumbnails) and hub-side **Mark Complete** / **Mark Not Complete** (`.launchdek-complete-step` / `.launchdek-uncomplete-step` → `/complete` / `/uncomplete`); honors `?run_id=` deep link on load; audit filters/table (`#launchdek-audit-*`), drift panel (`#launchdek-drift-status`, `#launchdek-verify-drift`) |
| `initTemplates()` | checklists (Templates tab) | no-ops unless `#launchdek-builtin-templates` exists; category tabs (`#launchdek-category-tabs`, `#launchdek-category-description`), built-in grid, custom checklists (`#launchdek-custom-checklists`), vault save (`#launchdek-vault-checklist`, `#launchdek-save-vault`), vault list (`#launchdek-vault-list`) |
