## Partials (`admin/partials/`)

Thin shells only — no business logic. Each page partial sets `data-launchdek-page` on `.launchdek-admin` root (including `settings`). Settings page uses Settings API form, not REST-driven CRUD.

Shared modal partials (require at end of page partial, do not duplicate markup):

| Partial | Included on |
|---------|-------------|
| `launchdek-onboarding-modal.php` | dashboard, settings |
| `launchdek-template-picker-modal.php` | dashboard, checklists, settings |

Dashboard and settings include both modals (onboarding opens the picker from step 1). Checklists includes the template picker and auto-capture modal inline. Sites page includes push checklist and connection tester modals inline (not shared partials).

## Client panel assets (`mu-plugin/launchdek-client/`)

Bundled mu-plugin admin UI — not loaded by hub `launchdek-admin` handle. Enqueued on remote wp-admin only when `LAUNCHDEK_Client_Run_Store::get()` returns an active snapshot.

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `css/launchdek-client-admin.css` | Panel styles — prefix `.launchdek-client-*` |
| `js/launchdek-client-admin.js` | Panel UI — IIFE, `launchdekClient` global (`restUrl`, `nonce`, `run`, `currentUser`, `strings`); uses `wp.media` for optional screenshot attachments; note collapse prefs in `localStorage` |

Key helpers: `applyOptimisticStepUpdate()` / `updateStepStatus()` — optimistic complete/uncomplete with rollback on error; hub callbacks return updated `run` (no redundant hub→client re-sync). Step complete/uncomplete posts `POST /client/run/steps/{step}/complete|uncomplete` → hub token route → applies returned snapshot via `save()` / `patch_from_hub_run()`. `minimizeAllNotes()` / `expandAllNotes()` bulk-toggle note sections; per-step `.launchdek-client-step-notes-toggle` collapses individual note lists.

Key panel classes: `.launchdek-client-panel-root`, `.launchdek-client-panel`, `.launchdek-client-panel-tab`, `.launchdek-client-panel-toggle`, `.launchdek-client-panel-notes-toolbar`, `.launchdek-client-toggle-all-notes` (`#launchdek-client-toggle-all-notes`), `.launchdek-client-step`, `.launchdek-client-step-settings-link` (compact deep-link icon beside step actions), `.launchdek-client-step-notes`, `.launchdek-client-step-notes-toggle`, `.launchdek-client-note-attachment`, `.launchdek-client-run-complete-summary`, `.launchdek-client-dismiss-run`. Layout modifiers on root/body: `.launchdek-client-layout-{sidebar|left_sidebar|split_panel|live_topbar|bottom_dock|floating_pill|toast|admin_menu|fullscreen|focus_mode|inline_metabox}`; `body.launchdek-client-has-panel`. Modifiers: `.is-collapsed` on panel root/panel/step notes; `.is-completed` on steps; `.is-admin-hidden` on `admin_menu` layout. Completed runs show summary + **Dismiss** (`POST /client/run/dismiss`).

## Enqueuing

| Handle | File | When |
|--------|------|------|
| `launchdek-admin` (style) | `admin/css/launchdek-admin.css` | `is_plugin_screen()` |
| `launchdek-admin` (script) | `admin/js/launchdek-admin.js` | `is_plugin_screen()` + `wp_localize_script` |

Version: `filemtime()` when file exists, otherwise `LAUNCHDEK_VERSION`.
